Review corrections
==================

The final records retain all three API-excluded watchdog intervals:
indivisible primitive work, emergency rollback cleanup, and caller
continuation reconstruction/validation.  Rollback observability is recorded
as a hypothesis test, not a guarantee of return.  P42 records reproduction of
only its completion/result pair; no cutoff state or path prefix is claimed.
The targeted residual-overclaim `rg` check reports no forbidden old wording.
Post-review checksum, schema, poll-equality, portable shell/AWK and diff checks
all return status 0.  The strict determinism check still returns status 1 only
for the retained P42 time-censored counter mismatch.

